Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.52,1:31:19.02,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,303,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(7177,7500,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}想待在你身边 想再靠近一点
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.02,1:31:26.83,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,286,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(7595,7810,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}你看 我鼓起了勇气
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.83,1:31:34.13,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,309,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(6954,7300,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}想紧紧拥抱 我重要的人
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.13,1:31:41.50,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,293,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(7118,7370,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}那份温暖 逐渐填满了
