Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.25,1:31:03.37,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,259,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(6860,7120,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}願いごとを 囁いたら
